DESCRIPTION:Zoud GameLab is a month-long virtual game jam run by Global Gam
 e Jam and Zoud\, the UAE's national financial wellbeing initiative\, under
  the theme Make FinLit Fun. Participants build a game that integrates fina
 ncial literacy in a meaningful way\; this is part of the judging criteria\
 , and a scoring rubric is published on the jam page.\n\nOrganisation: Zoud
  (UAE National Financial Wellbeing and Sustainability Initiative) with Glo
 bal Game Jam\nLocation: Online\, worldwide. Open to participants aged 18 a
 nd over in any country\; solo developers\, teams of any size and studios.\
 nAward: Shared prize and development-support funding pool of up to USD 140
 \,000 across best overall game\, runner-up\, third place\, financial-liter
 acy impact\, regional perspective\, compelling gameplay and a Best Game fr
 om the UAE award\; individual prize amounts are not published. No entry fe
 e.\nDuration: Month-long online jam\, 15 October to 15 November 2026\; win
 ners announced December 2026.\n\nMore: https://itch.io/jam/zoud-gamelab?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
